#### C. Critical Integration Points
Show exactly how external systems connect:
```python
# Example: VPN TUN interface setup
tun = TunInterface('/dev/net/tun')
tun.open('tun0', IFF_TUN | IFF_NO_PI)
while True:
    packet = tun.read(1500)  # Read from TUN
    encrypted = tunnel.encrypt(packet)
    server_socket.send(encrypted)  # Send to VPN server
    
    response = server_socket.recv(1500)
    decrypted = tunnel.decrypt(response)
    tun.write(decrypted)  # Write back to TUN
```

